  "description": "AutoFactories is used to generate factories and matching interfaces for types\n       you define in your project. By marking your types with [AutoFactory] the source\n       generator will generate a `{ClassName}Factory` and `I{ClassName}Factory` which \n       can be used to create instances of your type. Any parameters marked with [FromFactory]\n       will be provided by the factory.\n     \n\n      Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration: configures AutoFactories to generate\n      factories that resolve [FromFactory] parameters from an IServiceProvider, and adds extension\n      methods to register the generated factories and their interfaces with the built-in\n      Microsoft dependency injection container.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.jpg",
